From 8b856cb3ddbecaf44a7a6b443b4b1f41131e4f91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:14:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] perf(block): key shape caches by BlockState

getShape/getCollisionShape built blockState.toString() on every call,
even on cache hits. Key the per-block caches by the canonical BlockState
(1:1 with its string) in a ConcurrentHashMap, and compute the string only
on a miss for the global String-keyed maps. Miss path, side-effect order
and returned VoxelShape objects are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TD7PJ5R7t7hM3ymeeqXP4H
---
